zig17 (0.17.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of zig17 package for danklinux
  * Binary repackaging of official Zig 0.17.0 release
  * Required for Ghostty 1.4.0 (minimum_zig_version = 0.17.0)
  * Installs to /usr/lib/zig-0.17.0 with /usr/bin/zig-0.17 symlink
  * Can coexist with zig16 and other Zig versions

